libmcfp
------------------------------------------
Library for parsing command line arguments and configuration files

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libmcfp-devel-2.1.1-1bl1
  libmcfp2-2.1.1-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libCatch2-devel-3.16.1-1bl2
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/mhekkel/libmcfp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/mhekkel/libmcfp/archive/refs/tags/v2.1.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libmcfp-2.1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libmcfp-2.1.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libmcfp-2.1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmcfp-2.1.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmcfp2-2.1.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmcfp-devel-2.1.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libmcfp)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libmcfp.README
  /usr/share/doc/libmcfp/BSD-2-Clause.txt
  /usr/share/doc/libmcfp/CC0-1.0.txt
  /usr/share/doc/libmcfp/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/libmcfp/README.md

(libmcfp2)
  /usr/bin/cygmcfp-2.dll

(libmcfp-devel)
  /usr/include/mcfp/charconv.hpp
  /usr/include/mcfp/error.hpp
  /usr/include/mcfp/export.hpp
  /usr/include/mcfp/mcfp.hpp
  /usr/include/mcfp/options.hpp
  /usr/include/mcfp/sections.hpp
  /usr/include/mcfp/text.hpp
  /usr/lib/cmake/mcfp/mcfp-config-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/mcfp/mcfp-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/mcfp/mcfp-targets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/mcfp/mcfp-targets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libmcfp.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libmcfp.pc

